{"id":"e3bc57264117a705","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-l-fo-dtc.md","title":"FO(DTC) 刻画确定性对数空间","display":"thm-l-fo-dtc — FO(DTC) 刻画确定性对数空间","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-l-fo-dtc","aliases":["29-thm-l-fo-dtc"],"display":"thm-l-fo-dtc — FO(DTC) 刻画确定性对数空间","depends_on":["[[29-df-fo-q-fo]]","[[29-df-fo-dtc]]","[[29-df-ordering]]","[[29-df-complexity-classes]]","[[29-df-bin-encoding]]"],"source_locator":"Theorem 9.11, p.144, DjVu scan 159","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；陈述已对照，证明核对范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-l-fo-dtc"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-l-fo-dtc</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-l-fo-dtc — FO(DTC) 刻画确定性对数空间"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"37df1473b45d1ebc\" href=\"?note=37df1473b45d1ebc\" title=\"29-df-fo-dtc\">29-df-fo-dtc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" href=\"?note=4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" title=\"29-df-ordering\">29-df-ordering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2017fdd1c0072445\" href=\"?note=2017fdd1c0072445\" title=\"29-df-complexity-classes\">29-df-complexity-classes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"57d3a90cf94ef42e\" href=\"?note=57d3a90cf94ef42e\" title=\"29-df-bin-encoding\">29-df-bin-encoding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 9.11, p.144, DjVu scan 159"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；陈述已对照，证明核对范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为有限关系输入词汇；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span> 为新增的内建线性序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_\\tau\\coloneqq\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathcal O_\\tau\\coloneqq\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>，查询在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_\\tau\">\\(\\mathcal O_\\tau\\)</span> 上取值；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=(A,L)\">\\(U=(A,L)\\)</span> 的实际带序结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\">\\(\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a>；有限编码见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"57d3a90cf94ef42e\" href=\"?note=57d3a90cf94ef42e\" title=\"29-df-bin-encoding\">29-df-bin-encoding</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{L}^{&lt;}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{L}^{&lt;}[\\tau]\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2017fdd1c0072445\" href=\"?note=2017fdd1c0072445\" title=\"29-df-complexity-classes\">29-df-complexity-classes</a> 的有序结构查询类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 为域大小；固定词汇下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\log n\">\\(\\log n\\)</span> 与编码长度的对数相差常数因子。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DTC}\">\\(\\mathrm{DTC}\\)</span> 标记 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"37df1473b45d1ebc\" href=\"?note=37df1473b45d1ebc\" title=\"29-df-fo-dtc\">29-df-fo-dtc</a> 的句子及递归满足关系。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{L}^{&lt;}[\\tau]=\\{\\{U\\in\\mathcal O_\\tau\\mid\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\\models_{\\mathrm{DTC}}\\phi\\}\\mid\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO(DTC)}}[\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;\\}]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{L}^{&lt;}[\\tau]=\\{\\{U\\in\\mathcal O_\\tau\\mid\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)\\models_{\\mathrm{DTC}}\\phi\\}\\mid\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO(DTC)}}[\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;\\}]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 9.11，印刷页 144，扫描页 159；本次核对陈述及该页两向证明。上界顺序枚举唯一后继并以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|^k\">\\(|A|^k\\)</span> 截断循环，下界以确定性配置图把 L 查询一阶归约到 REACH_d。等式两边均为有序结构查询类，未把语法字符串集合直接等同于机器语言类。</p>\n<p>本轮显式拉回有序对输入；DTC 的关系级语义仍为删除多后继源点的全部出边再取反身闭包，只要求所选路径的每一步出边唯一，不要求图中无关顶点也函数化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-fo-q-fo","status":"resolved","id":"b89b00b2e37a4ae5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-q-fo]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-dtc","status":"resolved","id":"37df1473b45d1ebc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-dtc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ordering","status":"resolved","id":"4f651c8d1bdc9a58","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ordering]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-complexity-classes","status":"resolved","id":"2017fdd1c0072445","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-complexity-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-bin-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"57d3a90cf94ef42e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-bin-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-q-fo","status":"resolved","id":"b89b00b2e37a4ae5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal O_\\tau\\coloneqq\\mathr